ournament venue for this iteration of Hyakunin Ikki.","nextNodeIds":[726820203,726820204]},{"nodeId":726820203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3727525970,"text":"Oh, that's pretty exciting.","nextNodeIds":[726820205]},{"nodeId":726820205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","textMapHash":2018186298,"text":"The rules probably have not changed much. Monsters, adventurers, and warriors from across the world, who share a common yearning for fight, will quench their thirst on this stage through passionate battle.","nextNodeIds":[726820206]},{"nodeId":726820206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","textMapHash":672155122,"text":"Just like last time, feel free to bring your friends and companions! After all, the \"Hyakunin\" in \"Hyakunin Ikki\" means the more, the merrier!","nextNodeIds":[726820207]},{"nodeId":726820207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","textMapHash":1972870026,"text":"I'm looking forward to your performance.","nextNodeIds":[726820208]},{"nodeId":726820208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3231633146,"text":"Are you not going to participate this time either?","nextNodeIds":[726820209]},{"nodeId":726820209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","textMapHash":1096651690,"text":"Oh, of course I will — as a spectator, cheering you on!","nextNodeIds":[726820210]},{"nodeId":726820210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","textMapHash":425714090,"text":"After all, what I aspire to do is write the most thrilling action novels, not become a gallant warrior like you.","nextNodeIds":[726820211]},{"nodeId":726820211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","textMapHash":3708556106,"text":"...And my gut tells me that your star will shine brightest in this arena.","nextNodeIds":[726820212,726820213]},{"nodeId":726820212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3802405882,"text":"I will do my best.","nextNodeIds":[726820214]},{"nodeId":726820214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","textMapHash":3838521682,"text":"Yes, I'm sure you'll show me the most dazzling blade-dance again this time.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726820213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1995377674,"text":"Wait to be impressed.","nextNodeIds":[726820214]},{"nodeId":726820204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1519197810,"text":"That's quite troublesome.","nextNodeIds":[726820205]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7268202,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30065"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7268201,7268202],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30065,"speakerName":"Kayabuki Ikkei","count":20},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":13}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[172682],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":97046654,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBB